## Proactive Triggers

- **After code changes**: `test-writer-fixer` runs tests and fixes failures
- **After UI/UX changes**: `whimsy-injector` adds delightful interactions
- **When feature flags added**: `experiment-tracker` sets up validation
- **Complex multi-agent tasks**: `studio-coach` (in `bonus/`) coordinates

## Project Creation Usage

- `rapid-prototyper` scaffolds and implements core features
- `test-writer-fixer` writes comprehensive test suites
- `ui-designer` creates component libraries
- `backend-architect` or `frontend-developer` for architecture decisions
- `performance-benchmarker` ensures fast load times

## Principles

- 6-day sprint philosophy (rapid iteration, ship fast)
- Agents collaborate via the Task tool
- Prioritize shipping working features over perfect implementations

Refer to agent markdown files for detailed capabilities and system prompts.
